    {
      "id": "f7b8b6a8-1c01-441c-854d-30a7d60c8b09",
      "name": "Sticky Note a7a86e2f",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        784,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\n1. **Settings**: `llmUrl` = your LiteLLM `/v1/chat/completions` URL, `model` = the model to try. The OpenAI credential supplies the key.\n2. Ghost Admin → Integrations → custom integration → two webhooks to the production URL of **Ghost Webhook**:\n   - *Post published* → `...?event=published`\n   - *Published post updated* → `...?event=edited`\n3. Tags: `#resumen` opts a post in. `#resumen-refresh` regenerates (removed automatically).\n\nThe summary is a closed toggle card at the top of the post, headed \"resumen\" (or \"summary\" for English posts). Edit it in Ghost freely; it is only rewritten on refresh.",
        "color": 4
      }
    }
